      "assets": [
        {
          "kind": "cg",
          "path": "assets/cg/lantern-festival.webp",
          "prompt": "Anime-painterly slice-of-life illustration in the style of a LivingCanvas world cover, soft cel shading with painterly light, a small island village on a calm sea, warm golden sunlight against sea-glass blues, fine film grain, no text, no lettering. The summer lantern festival in the village square at night, all the islanders in light yukata under strings of paper lanterns, Hana at a stall, Toma drumming, Mio with a candy apple, everyone looking up at small fireworks. Same characters as the references. Wide 16:9."
        }
      ]
